<title>USA: Forest City to buy back 250,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Forest City to buy back 250,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forest City Enterprises Inc said Monday it would buy back up to 250,000 Class A and Class B shares.</p>
<p>The buys are to take place on the open market. The company already has repurchased 250,000 shares so far in 1996.</p>
<p>The company now has 5,126,098 Class A shares and 3,615,516 Class B shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Forest City, a real estate development and management company, did not say what it planned to do with the repurchased shares.</p>
